Show DHCP configuration

Usage:
  olr dhcp show [flags]
  olr dhcp show [command]

Available Commands:
  leases       List current leases
  pool         Show one pool in full
  pools        List address pools
  reservation  Show one reservation in full
  reservations List address reservations

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for show

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr dhcp show [command] --help" for more information about a command.
